{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1058831/block/singleImage/3240767/df/01M51D936Y4MCGSMN4XE24D26F.jpeg?updatedAt=1792142770\"/><figcaption>重陽登高 切勿燒山</figcaption></figure><p>重陽將至，長春社提提大家，於登高祭祖時，要小心火種，以免引致山火。於 焚燒香燭冥鏹時， 必須嚴格遵守防火安全規定，如在 燃燒香燭、冥鏹及化寶時，必須放於 化寶盆或鐵桶內；切勿用火清除墓地周邊的雜草 或垃圾，離開墓地或山頭前，必須檢查並確保所有香燭及灰燼 完全熄滅 ，不留任何火種。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T10:19:50.916317+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T09:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T14:38:35.592557+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T10:17:40.103240+00:00","content_hash":"884390baff10d3f22ef43031de5a84eebe3247c1ac4becdc408d73e2379e987f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}